None of these carries the inline `Excerpt: Linux v7.2.3 <file>:<lines>` marker
that `net`, `mount`, `aio`, and `random` use; adding it is a source-side
follow-up owned by this package, not by the licence documents.

Those fragments are GPL-2.0-only, (C) The Linux Kernel Authors. They are comment
